# IMDb SQL Analysis Project

This project demonstrates my data analysis skills using SQL to analyze a movie dataset and extract meaningful insights.

## Objective
To analyze movie data and identify trends in ratings, genres, and production patterns.

## Dataset
IMDb movie dataset containing information about movies, ratings, genres, and release details.

## Tools Used
- SQL

## Steps Performed
- Data filtering and aggregation
- Joins between multiple tables
- Grouping and ordering data
- Writing complex SQL queries

## Key Insights
- Certain genres have higher ratings
- Trend observed in movie releases over years
- Popular directors and production companies identified

## Conclusion
This analysis helps understand movie trends and supports data-driven decision making.
